//
// Dynamatic's RTL library is not written with Verilator's lint checks in mind
// (unused ports/parameters of generic components, width mismatches in
// parameterised ones, initial blocks, etc.). None of this is X-HEEP's own code
// to fix -- waive it wholesale for the generated sources only.
// hw/fpga/hls/dynamatic/dot_product's hand-written integration code
// (rtl/dot_product_hls_adapter.sv, rtl/dot_product_operand_buffer.sv, and the
// shared register file and wrapper under hw/fpga/hls/common/dot_product/) is
// deliberately NOT covered here: its warnings are fixed at the source instead.

`verilator_config

lint_off -file "*/hw/fpga/hls/dynamatic/dot_product/rtl/hls/*"
